flowchart TD
    A[User Task] -->|task string| B["LearnKit.learn / .agent wrapper - model path<br/>learning_mode = 'learn'"]
    B -->|prepare_run task| C["Classifier classify_task<br/>(offline heuristic or LLM)"]
    C -->|ClassificationOutput domains/task_type| D[SemanticRetriever.retrieve]
    D -->|query/domain/scope| E[Backend search / hybrid_search]
    E -->|candidate MemoryRecords| F[MemoryRouter.route]
    F -->|top records bounded by count + token budget| G[determine_inference_mode]
    G -->|prescriptive/guided/exploratory| H[compose_context]
    H -->|_learnkit_context string| I[Wrapped agent function]
    I -->|system + user prompt| J[LLM Provider]
    J -->|response text| K[finalize_run]

    K -->|trajectory + response| L[Evaluator.evaluate_with_llm_judge]
    L --> L1{judge available}
    L1 -->|no key / offline| L2["heuristic_score - deterministic<br/>signal = HEURISTIC"]
    L1 -->|yes| L3[LLM judge score 0-5]
    L2 --> M{score >= quality_threshold}
    L3 --> M

    M -->|yes| N[MemoryDistiller.distill]
    N -->|skill/facts/failures/trace| O[memory_quality.decide_storage]
    M -->|no| P[MemoryDistiller.distill_failure]
    P -->|FailureRecord active| O
    O -->|store/reinforce/demote decisions| Q[Backend add/replace/update]
    Q -->|persisted records<br/>expires_at=None when record_ttl off| R[(SQLite records + FTS + optional vec)]

    K -->|_persist_run telemetry| T["Backend.insert_run<br/>mode / tokens / cost / latency / models"]
    T --> U[(SQLite runs table)]

    K -->|final response| S[Caller receives output]
    U -.->|read by| DASH["FastAPI /api/v1/* -> React dashboard"]
    R -.->|read by| DASH

